<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-10-31T22:38:39.504Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 22:38:39 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iranian Revolutionary Guard forces report three tankers ablaze and mines hitting four tankers in the Strait of Hormuz, while Iran’s foreign minister welcomes US outreach during a Qatari mediation visit. Iran’s supreme leader orders the military to expand retaliation plans without geographic limits, and Iran’s security chief debates discarding the nuclear weapons ban. Iranian envoys meet Qatari mediators as the United States threatens strikes after the midterms, and Iran’s strikes on U.S. Middle East bases are found to have disabled early-warning systems. 123 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/30/irans-revolutionary-guard-reports-two-tankers-on-fire-in-strait-of-hormuz-as-talks-continu&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168682&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQcC1sSkxtLWVVWVpCXzVQc1pIeHhrdnBEYkY1ZjZmQjQtZE9CdWNOdkFPalphUHVmWTJ0dk1NUUNtX2Y4RVJ1U0FQZ21BM1VkQTFUOU1IVHNRd2kwMGs4c0VqUG81X2hRbVlvU0NCOFRiYjR4TDdhajltTmRRazJBbUotYUs3Q3o0aEg4UDBONEhodw?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNYktaLU9ndHRTeW11V3cwLWI1anZkMDJjeXNvZXVONEp2bXA0Z3o2N3BnSmRGM3ZCZURuS3phc2M0N3plU1JGeVN0amJYd21uS0NUNEFtUE1IMFNHaWVoZWpmd05CNkNfRUk4cE1EWjRKbjE2WWgtYUloczRMem1Ya1FIN0ZrMkprRHFHUnlTd000bFd1UE1JdndzamhTeFRWeVQ0?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxOdk1rSkhYRW1adHdyNDc1UWNPalVweEtya0Z0cUFOTWMxRU5qWGp3ekRscnZrZGVBZW5Wa2tYVGdieG9DcDVIYXBjQ29wQUpMWFZQSWVpWW9GTF9oaGkwRGM2WWlrWWNkM1gtSUtwS3hsc2V0aXhFZUVwTnZqZS1lWGFEaUJOZkNDaHhNeTQxLWR